OL,3,GNEWSA'Exciting' to see Stonehenge
OL,4,Aartefacts go on loan
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of unique artefacts discovered
OL,7,Fat Stonehenge have been loaned to an
OL,8,Farchaeological museum in Germany as
OL,9,Fpart of an "exciting" special
OL,10,Fexhibition.
OL,12,FThe exhibition, entitled Stonehenge:
OL,13,FAncient Secrets, New Discoveries is now
OL,14,Fon display at the Archaeological State
OL,15,FCollection in Munich until August next
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FRoughly 600 objects including antler
OL,19,Fpicks, animal bones, hammer stones,
OL,20,Fearrings and a dagger have been lent by
OL,21,Finstitutions including The Salisbury
OL,22,FMuseum and Wiltshire Museum.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
