OL,3,GNEWSA'Exciting' to see Stonehenge
OL,4,Aartefacts go on loan
OL,5,
OL,6,FDr Heiner Schwarzberg, museum curator,
OL,7,Fsaid that Stonehenge was "a wonder of
OL,8,Fthe world" and that it was an "honour"
OL,9,Fto host the exhibition.
